# Marketing skills + Illuminairy copy

**Installed skills:** `.agents/skills/` from [marketingskills](https://github.com/coreyhaines31/marketingskills). Usage map: [`growth/marketingskills-usage.md`](../../growth/marketingskills-usage.md).

## Required read order

1. [`.agents/product-marketing.md`](../../.agents/product-marketing.md)
2. [`docs/messaging-guide.md`](../../docs/messaging-guide.md) and [`growth/funnel-strategy.md`](../../growth/funnel-strategy.md)
3. [`.cursor/rules/banned-copy-phrases.mdc`](banned-copy-phrases.mdc)

**Illuminairy rules override** generic marketing skill output (product names, banned phrases, stats from `lib/site.ts` only).

## Locked vocabulary

- **SAT Improvement Plan** (not quiz, not Score Path)
- **SAT Strategy Call** · **Skill Diagnostic** · **personalized weekly plan**
- Cold LP: **staged disclosure** — plan-first CTA; defer tutor/tuition until after Plan Builder

## Do not

- Install all 43 upstream skills into this repo without owner approval
- Let skills suggest "free quiz," score guarantees, or College Board ~115 Khan stat
